<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - LCI buy reiterated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - LCI buy reiterated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it reiterated its buy rating on LCI International Inc.</p>
<p>-- Raised target mid-1997 target price to 45, based on 1998 earnings estimate of $1.60 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-1/2 to 35-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
